// 阶段3课程数据（第27-39周），由 H5 版自动提取
module.exports = [{"w":27,"p":3,"theme":"学术英语入门（虚拟语气）","d":[{"t":"学术核心词I","obj":"掌握5个学术高频词，学会wish虚拟","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"research","m":"研究","p":"n./v.","e":"The research lasted three years."},{"w":"analysis","m":"分析","p":"n.","e":"The analysis shows a clear trend."},{"w":"data","m":"数据","p":"n.","e":"The data comes from 200 families."},{"w":"theory","m":"理论","p":"n.","e":"The theory explains the result."},{"w":"evidence","m":"证据","p":"n.","e":"There is strong evidence for this."}],"g":{"t":"虚拟语气：wish + 过去式（对现在的愿望）","exp":"I wish I had more time.（真希望我有更多时间——现实是没有。）wish后用过去式表“与现在事实相反”。I wish I knew就是“可惜我不知道”。遗憾表达的开始。","ex":["I wish I had more free time.","She wishes she understood the theory.","I wish the exam were easier."]},"pr":"1) 用wish+过去式写5句自己的遗憾。2) 把5个新词各造1句（学术语境）。3) 口语讨论：你希望现在改变什么？","tip":"学术词汇（AWL）是雅思阅读听力的入场券。这周起，每天5个，三个月拿下约160个高频学术词。"},{"t":"学术核心词II","obj":"掌握研究流程词汇，学会would rather","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"method","m":"方法","p":"n.","e":"The method is simple but effective."},{"w":"result","m":"结果","p":"n.","e":"The results surprised the team."},{"w":"conclusion","m":"结论","p":"n.","e":"The conclusion supports the theory."},{"w":"survey","m":"调查","p":"n./v.","e":"The survey covered 1,000 people."},{"w":"experiment","m":"实验","p":"n.","e":"The experiment needs repeating."}],"g":{"t":"would rather（宁愿）","exp":"I would rather stay home than go out.（我宁愿待在家。）would rather do A than do B。虚拟版：I would rather you didn't smoke here.（我宁愿你别在这抽烟。）语气委婉。","ex":["I would rather study online.","She would rather walk than drive.","I would rather you came tomorrow."]},"pr":"1) 用would rather写5句（含1句对别人的委婉请求）。2) 写“一项我关注的调查”5句。3) 口语讨论：线上还是线下学习？","tip":"would rather是口语表态神器：I'd rather...比I don't want to礼貌十倍。"},{"t":"学术核心词III","obj":"掌握抽象名词，学会if only","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"significant","m":"重要的；显著的","p":"adj.","e":"The change is significant."},{"w":"factor","m":"因素","p":"n.","e":"Money is one key factor."},{"w":"impact","m":"影响","p":"n./v.","e":"The impact was huge."},{"w":"role","m":"角色；作用","p":"n.","e":"Parents play a key role."},{"w":"function","m":"功能；起作用","p":"n./v.","e":"Its main function is to teach."}],"g":{"t":"if only（要是...就好了）","exp":"If only I had started earlier!（要是早点开始就好了！）= I wish I had started earlier. 感叹版虚拟。比wish语气更强烈，写作口语都出彩。","ex":["If only I knew the answer!","If only money grew on trees.","If only the test were next month!"]},"pr":"1) 用if only写5句感叹。2) 用significant/factor/impact各造1句。3) 口语讨论：学习中最遗憾的事？","tip":"雅思阅读题干最爱把important换成significant，factor/role/impact是同义替换三兄弟。"},{"t":"学术核心词IV","obj":"掌握概念类词汇，学会倒装句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"concept","m":"概念","p":"n.","e":"The concept is hard to define."},{"w":"define","m":"定义","p":"v.","e":"First, define your terms."},{"w":"category","m":"类别","p":"n.","e":"Books fall into two categories."},{"w":"specific","m":"具体的","p":"adj.","e":"Give a specific example."},{"w":"criteria","m":"标准","p":"n.","e":"The criteria are clear."}],"g":{"t":"倒装句（Never have I...）","exp":"否定词开头句子半倒装：Never have I seen such a result.（我从未见过这样的结果。）= I have never seen... 同类：Rarely / Seldom / Not only...but also。写作里一用，句式复杂度立刻上档次。","ex":["Never have I read such a clear report.","Rarely does one study change a theory.","Not only is the method new, but it is also cheap."]},"pr":"1) 写5句倒装句（Never/Rarely/Not only开头）。2) 用新词写3句学术句。3) 口语讨论：怎么定义“成功”？","tip":"倒装句是7分写作的分水岭。一周写一次，慢慢就顺了。"},{"t":"学术核心词V","obj":"掌握框架类词汇，学会so/such倒装","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"approach","m":"方法；途径","p":"n./v.","e":"Try a different approach."},{"w":"framework","m":"框架","p":"n.","e":"The framework guides the study."},{"w":"perspective","m":"视角；观点","p":"n.","e":"Look from a new perspective."},{"w":"principle","m":"原则；原理","p":"n.","e":"The principle is simple."},{"w":"assume","m":"假设；假定","p":"v.","e":"Let us assume the data is right."}],"g":{"t":"so...that / such...that 的倒装","exp":"So significant was the impact that the theory changed.（影响如此之大，以至于理论都变了。）So/Such放句首时倒装。正式文体专用，7分+句型。","ex":["So complex was the concept that few understood it.","Such was the impact that everything changed.","So obvious was the result that no one argued."]},"pr":"1) 写3句So/Such倒装。2) 用approach/perspective/principle各造1句。3) 口语讨论：学英语最好的方法是什么？","tip":"本周25个学术词是阅读题干的“高频面孔”。把它们做卡片，正面英文背面中文，碎片时间翻。"}],"sun":{"t":"第27周自检：学术入门","obj":"检验虚拟语气和学术词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 语法专项15题（wish/would rather/if only/倒装）。3) 阅读练习：找一篇雅思风格短文（可用真题P1），划出所有学术词和倒装句。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"阶段三的周日增加“真题接触”：每周至少精读一篇雅思文章，把学到的语法在真实文章里“验明正身”。"}},{"w":28,"p":3,"theme":"数据与图表表达","d":[{"t":"趋势动词","obj":"掌握图表核心动词，学会only after倒装","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"increase","m":"增加","p":"v./n.","e":"Sales increased by 20%."},{"w":"decrease","m":"减少","p":"v./n.","e":"Costs decreased slowly."},{"w":"fluctuate","m":"波动","p":"v.","e":"Prices fluctuated all year."},{"w":"stabilize","m":"稳定下来","p":"v.","e":"The market stabilized in June."},{"w":"peak","m":"达到峰值","p":"v./n.","e":"Demand peaked in December."}],"g":{"t":"only after / only when 倒装","exp":"Only after the survey did we understand the problem.（直到调查后我们才明白问题。）Only+状语放句首要倒装。图表作文的高级句式：Only in 2020 did the numbers fall.","ex":["Only after the reform did sales rise.","Only when prices fell did demand grow.","Only in summer does usage peak."]},"pr":"1) 写3句only倒装（图表语境）。2) 用5个趋势动词各写1句（搭配数字）。3) 找一张折线图，口头描述趋势。","tip":"趋势动词+数字（by 20% / from 5 to 8）是Task 1的句子骨架，今天开始组装。"},{"t":"数据表达","obj":"掌握分数比例表达，掌握倍数句型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"average","m":"平均（的）","p":"n./adj.","e":"The average score was 6.2."},{"w":"majority","m":"多数","p":"n.","e":"A majority chose online classes."},{"w":"proportion","m":"比例","p":"n.","e":"The proportion rose to 40%."},{"w":"quarter","m":"四分之一","p":"n.","e":"A quarter of users left."},{"w":"triple","m":"增至三倍","p":"v./adj.","e":"Users tripled in a year."}],"g":{"t":"as...as 倍数与比较句型","exp":"倍数表达三件套：A is twice as high as B（A是B的两倍高）/ The number doubled（翻倍了）/ It tripled（增至三倍）。比例表达：a quarter of / half of / two thirds of。图表数字的“翻译器”。","ex":["Online sales are twice as high as store sales.","The figure doubled within a year.","Two thirds of students chose the app."]},"pr":"1) 写5句倍数/比例句（编数据也行）。2) 把中文数据“60%的人”写成三种英文表达。3) 口头描述一张饼图。","tip":"Task 1拿6.5的关键不是词汇多难，而是数据表达准确+句型多变。同一数据会用两种说法，就赢了。"},{"t":"因果表达","obj":"掌握因果连接词，掌握分词短语作状语","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"cause","m":"导致；原因","p":"v./n.","e":"Stress causes health problems."},{"w":"lead to","m":"导致","p":"phr.v.","e":"Poor sleep leads to poor focus."},{"w":"result in","m":"造成","p":"phr.v.","e":"The change resulted in growth."},{"w":"contribute to","m":"促成","p":"phr.v.","e":"Diet contributes to health."},{"w":"attribute","m":"把...归因于","p":"v.","e":"He attributes success to habits."}],"g":{"t":"分词短语作状语（...ing / ...ed 句首）","exp":"Chart description upgrade: Looking at the chart, we can see a clear trend.（看图表，我们能看出趋势。）表被动用过去分词：Compared with 2019, the number is higher. 句式立刻精简。","ex":["Looking at the data, we find a surprise.","Compared with last year, costs fell.","Having risen for years, prices finally dropped."]},"pr":"1) 写3句分词开头（图表语境）。2) 用5个因果词各写1句。3) 把一段流水账改成分词开头版。","tip":"分词状语=句子减肥药。Task 1字数紧张时，它是最好的“压缩器”。"},{"t":"对比表达","obj":"掌握对比连接词，掌握with复合结构","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"whereas","m":"然而（对比）","p":"conj.","e":"Sales rose, whereas costs fell."},{"w":"conversely","m":"相反地","p":"adv.","e":"Conversely, the south saw growth."},{"w":"similarly","m":"类似地","p":"adv.","e":"Similarly, the UK followed the trend."},{"w":"comparable","m":"可比的","p":"adj.","e":"The two years are comparable."},{"w":"contrast","m":"对比","p":"n./v.","e":"In contrast, numbers fell."}],"g":{"t":"with 复合结构（with + n + doing/done）","exp":"With demand growing, prices kept rising.（随着需求增长，价格持续上涨。）With + 名词 + 分词=迷你状语从句。图表作文高频神句：With the economy improving, spending doubled.","ex":["With costs falling, profits grew.","With more users joining, the app expanded.","With the plan finished, the team rested."]},"pr":"1) 写5句with复合结构（图表语境）。2) 用whereas/similarly/in contrast各写1句对比。3) 描述一张双线对比图。","tip":"with复合结构在Task 1里一出现，考官就知道你受过训练。写两个就够，别贪多。"},{"t":"预测表达","obj":"掌握预测句型，初识独立主格","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"anticipate","m":"预期","p":"v.","e":"We anticipate further growth."},{"w":"forecast","m":"预测","p":"v./n.","e":"The forecast shows more rain."},{"w":"project","m":"预计；项目","p":"v./n.","e":"Sales are projected to double."},{"w":"expect","m":"预计；期待","p":"v.","e":"Growth is expected to continue."},{"w":"likely","m":"可能的","p":"adj./adv.","e":"Prices are likely to rise."}],"g":{"t":"独立主格初步（with的升级版）","exp":"独立主格=主语+分词，前面有自己独立主语：Prices rising, families cut spending.（价格上升，家庭削减开支。）比with版更书面。图表作文结尾预测句常配：This trend continuing, sales will double by 2030.","ex":["The population growing, more schools are needed.","Prices falling, sales finally recovered.","Demand changing, the plan must change."]},"pr":"1) 写3句独立主格。2) 用5个预测词各写1句（预计...会...）。3) 完整口头描述一张图表：开头+趋势+对比+预测。","tip":"今天结束了图表表达五件套：趋势+数据+因果+对比+预测。Task 1的语言地基打完了，下周开始话题深挖。"}],"sun":{"t":"第28周自检：图表表达","obj":"检验图表语言和高级句型","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 图表片段写作：描述一张折线图（80词，用上倒装1句+分词1句+with结构1句）。3) 朗读自己的描述并录音。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"图表语言是“学术普通话”。无论话题是什么，这些句型通用——这就是为什么先学它。"}},{"w":29,"p":3,"theme":"教育话题深挖","d":[{"t":"教育体系词汇","obj":"掌握教育话题核心词，掌握主语从句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"curriculum","m":"课程体系","p":"n.","e":"The school updated its curriculum."},{"w":"tuition","m":"学费","p":"n.","e":"Tuition fees are rising fast."},{"w":"scholarship","m":"奖学金","p":"n.","e":"She won a full scholarship."},{"w":"literacy","m":"读写能力","p":"n.","e":"Reading improves literacy."},{"w":"academic","m":"学术的","p":"adj.","e":"His academic record is strong."}],"g":{"t":"主语从句（That... / What... 作主语）","exp":"That education matters is clear.（教育重要是显然的——太生硬）更常用it作形式主语：It is clear that education matters. What引导更自然：What matters most is curiosity.","ex":["It is true that tuition is expensive.","What schools need is more support.","That literacy matters goes without saying."]},"pr":"1) 写5句主语从句（it形式主语3句+What开头2句）。2) 用新词写3句教育现状。3) 口语讨论：学费贵值得吗？","tip":"教育话题词汇是雅思阅读文章的高频主料，也是口语Part 1工作学习题的弹药。"},{"t":"教育问题","obj":"掌握教育问题词汇，掌握表语从句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"dropout","m":"辍学者；辍学","p":"n.","e":"The dropout rate fell this year."},{"w":"discipline","m":"纪律；学科","p":"n.","e":"Discipline builds good habits."},{"w":"motivation","m":"动力","p":"n.","e":"Praise improves motivation."},{"w":"inequality","m":"不平等","p":"n.","e":"Education inequality is serious."},{"w":"rote learning","m":"死记硬背","p":"n.","e":"Rote learning has its limits."}],"g":{"t":"表语从句（The problem is that...）","exp":"The problem is that schools focus on tests.（问题在于学校盯着考试。）The reason why... is that...（...的原因是...）议论文引出论点的标配句。","ex":["The problem is that tuition is high.","The reason is that teachers are underpaid.","The truth is that rote learning works sometimes."]},"pr":"1) 写5句表语从句（教育问题）。2) 写“教育三大问题”提纲（每条1句）。3) 口语讨论：应试教育vs素质教育？","tip":"The problem is that...是讨论类作文的开头三剑客之一。教育话题词汇+这个句型=观点库第一格。"},{"t":"教育科技","obj":"掌握在线教育词汇，掌握同位语从句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"e-learning","m":"在线学习","p":"n.","e":"E-learning grew fast after 2020."},{"w":"interactive","m":"互动的","p":"adj.","e":"Interactive classes engage kids."},{"w":"accessible","m":"易获得的","p":"adj.","e":"The app is accessible to all."},{"w":"flexible","m":"灵活的","p":"adj.","e":"Flexible schedules suit workers."},{"w":"distraction","m":"干扰；分心","p":"n.","e":"Phones cause distraction in class."}],"g":{"t":"同位语从句（the fact that...）","exp":"The fact that e-learning is cheaper surprises no one.（在线学习更便宜这个事实不令人意外。）that后是完整句子解释前面的抽象名词（fact/news/idea/belief）。","ex":["The fact that classes moved online changed everything.","There is a belief that screens harm study.","The news that the school closed shocked us."]},"pr":"1) 写5句同位语从句（教育科技话题）。2) 写辩证段：网课的利弊（100词）。3) 口语讨论：网课会取代教室吗？","tip":"同位语从句和定语从句长得像，考试写作里用对是加分项。记窍门：that后句子完整=同位语。"},{"t":"教育理念","obj":"掌握教育理念词汇，分清同位语与定语从句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"compulsory","m":"义务的；强制的","p":"adj.","e":"Education is compulsory till 16."},{"w":"practical","m":"实用的；实践的","p":"adj.","e":"Practical skills matter too."},{"w":"theoretical","m":"理论的","p":"adj.","e":"The course is too theoretical."},{"w":"creativity","m":"创造力","p":"n.","e":"Art classes build creativity."},{"w":"critical thinking","m":"批判性思维","p":"n.","e":"Debate trains critical thinking."}],"g":{"t":"同位语从句 vs 定语从句（一秒分清）","exp":"The belief that practice makes perfect is old.（同位语：belief的内容=practice makes perfect）The belief that my teacher holds is old.（定语：that my teacher holds修饰belief，that作宾语可省）判断：that在从句里不作成分=同位语。","ex":["The idea that kids need play is spreading.","The idea (that) she suggested was rejected.","The fact that we passed made us cheer."]},"pr":"1) 各写3句同位语和定语从句并标注类型。2) 写“理想的教育”（100词，用上compulsory/practical/creativity）。3) 口语讨论：大学该教什么？","tip":"词汇进入深水区。critical thinking这类“概念词组”是口语写作的双料高频，直接整个背。"},{"t":"教育政策","obj":"掌握政策词汇，综合运用名词性从句","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"reform","m":"改革","p":"v./n.","e":"The reform started five years ago."},{"w":"funding","m":"拨款；资金","p":"n.","e":"School funding was cut."},{"w":"priority","m":"优先事项","p":"n.","e":"Education is a top priority."},{"w":"allocate","m":"分配","p":"v.","e":"The city allocated funds to schools."},{"w":"implement","m":"实施","p":"v.","e":"The plan was implemented in May."}],"g":{"t":"名词性从句综合运用","exp":"一篇好文章四种从句全上：主语从句（What matters is...）、宾语从句（People believe that...）、表语从句（The issue is that...）、同位语从句（the fact that...）。今天的写作练习全部用上。","ex":["What governments must decide is clear.","People believe that funding should grow.","The issue is that reforms take time.","The fact that budgets are tight limits plans."]},"pr":"1) 写一篇120词教育短文（四种从句各至少1句）。2) 用新词写3句政策句。3) 口语讨论：教育经费该增加吗？","tip":"教育是雅思写作第一大话题。今天这篇四从句短文，就是你的第一份话题满分模板。"}],"sun":{"t":"第29周自检：教育话题","obj":"检验名词性从句体系和教育词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 语法专项15题（同位语vs定语）。3) 写作：限时35分钟完成Some believe online education will replace classrooms. To what extent do you agree?（250词）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"第一次限时写作会很难受。没关系，记录用时——阶段四冲刺时你会回来重写，对比进步。"}},{"w":30,"p":3,"theme":"环境话题深挖","d":[{"t":"生态词汇","obj":"掌握生态核心词，掌握must have done","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"ecosystem","m":"生态系统","p":"n.","e":"Forests are rich ecosystems."},{"w":"biodiversity","m":"生物多样性","p":"n.","e":"Biodiversity is falling fast."},{"w":"deforestation","m":"滥伐森林","p":"n.","e":"Deforestation harms the climate."},{"w":"conservation","m":"保护（自然资源）","p":"n.","e":"Conservation saves species."},{"w":"emission","m":"排放","p":"n.","e":"Carbon emissions must fall."}],"g":{"t":"must have done（对过去的肯定推测）","exp":"The river must have been polluted for years.（这条河肯定被污染多年了。）= 有依据的推测。环境话题谈原因的利器：The climate must have changed.","ex":["The lake must have dried up last summer.","They must have cut the forest.","Prices must have risen."]},"pr":"1) 写5句must have done推测。2) 用新词写5句环境现状。3) 口语讨论：气候真的在变吗？","tip":"环境话题=雅思写作题库钉子户。这25词覆盖80%的环境类文章。"},{"t":"污染问题","obj":"掌握污染词汇，掌握should have done","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"smog","m":"雾霾","p":"n.","e":"Smog covered the city in winter."},{"w":"exhaust","m":"尾气；排气","p":"n./v.","e":"Car exhaust thickens smog."},{"w":"discharge","m":"排放（物）","p":"v./n.","e":"Factories discharge waste daily."},{"w":"purify","m":"净化","p":"v.","e":"Plants purify the water."},{"w":"toxic","m":"有毒的","p":"adj.","e":"The river turned toxic."}],"g":{"t":"should have done（本应该做而没做）","exp":"We should have acted ten years ago.（我们十年前就该行动了。）= 遗憾+批评。环境话题表达“悔棋”的利器：Governments should have banned plastic bags earlier.","ex":["The factory should have been fined.","We should have saved more water.","They shouldn't have built the dam."]},"pr":"1) 写5句should have done（环境遗憾清单）。2) 写“城市污染三大源头”（80词）。3) 口语讨论：污染该怪政府还是个人？","tip":"must have/should have是口语Part 3谈“过去该不该”的标配。说得越自然，考官越信你水平高。"},{"t":"资源问题","obj":"掌握资源词汇，掌握could have done","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"scarce","m":"稀缺的","p":"adj.","e":"Clean water is scarce here."},{"w":"abundant","m":"丰富的","p":"adj.","e":"Sunlight is abundant in deserts."},{"w":"exploit","m":"开发；利用","p":"v.","e":"We exploit solar power now."},{"w":"renewable","m":"可再生的","p":"adj.","e":"Wind is renewable energy."},{"w":"conserve","m":"节约；保存","p":"v.","e":"We conserve water at home."}],"g":{"t":"could have done（本可以做却没做）","exp":"We could have switched to solar years ago.（我们几年前本可以换太阳能的。）= 能力上有可能但没做。和should have（责任）区别开：could=可选项，should=应该项。","ex":["They could have saved the forest.","We could have invested in wind power.","The city could have built more parks."]},"pr":"1) 写5句could have done。2) 对比造句：should have / could have各2句同一话题。3) 口语讨论：可再生能源能救地球吗？","tip":"must/should/could have done是“情态完成时三兄弟”。口语写作里轮流出现，语法直接上6.5。"},{"t":"治理方案","obj":"掌握治理词汇，掌握needn't have done","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"legislation","m":"立法","p":"n.","e":"New legislation bans plastic bags."},{"w":"incentive","m":"激励措施","p":"n.","e":"Tax cuts are an incentive."},{"w":"awareness","m":"意识","p":"n.","e":"Public awareness is growing."},{"w":"campaign","m":"运动；活动","p":"n.","e":"The city launched a green campaign."},{"w":"impose","m":"强加；征收","p":"v.","e":"The state imposed a carbon tax."}],"g":{"t":"needn't have done（本不必做却做了）","exp":"We needn't have bought so many plastic bottles.（我们本不必买那么多塑料瓶的。）= 做了但没必要。四兄弟里最少用但最出彩的一个。","ex":["You needn't have printed the report.","We needn't have worried about the storm.","She needn't have paid full price."]},"pr":"1) 写5句needn't have done。2) 写“治理污染的三个办法”（100词，用上legislation/incentive/campaign）。3) 口语讨论：碳税好不好？","tip":"本周集齐情态完成时四兄弟（must/should/could/needn't have done）。口语里露两手，考官立刻知道你语法到家了。"},{"t":"环境辩论","obj":"综合运用环境话题进行辩证讨论","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"controversial","m":"有争议的","p":"adj.","e":"Nuclear power is controversial."},{"w":"urgent","m":"紧迫的","p":"adj.","e":"Climate change is urgent."},{"w":"irreversible","m":"不可逆的","p":"adj.","e":"The damage may be irreversible."},{"w":"sustainable","m":"可持续的","p":"adj.","e":"We need sustainable growth."},{"w":"debatable","m":"有待商榷的","p":"adj.","e":"The timeline is debatable."}],"g":{"t":"辩论句式包","exp":"正方：There is no doubt that... / It is widely accepted that... 让步：Admittedly, ... However, ... 反方：Some argue that..., while others point out that... 结论：On balance, ... 辩证讨论的完整弹药。","ex":["There is no doubt that the climate is changing.","Admittedly, green energy is costly. However, it saves lives.","On balance, the benefits outweigh the costs."]},"pr":"1) 写一段150词辩证讨论（Should cars be banned in city centers?）。2) 口语辩论练习：自己先说正方90秒，再说反方90秒。3) 整理环境话题金句卡。","tip":"环境话题词汇+辩证句式=写作7分套餐。今天的短文直接进素材库。"}],"sun":{"t":"第30周自检：环境话题","obj":"检验情态完成时和环境词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 语法专项15题（情态完成时四兄弟）。3) 写作：限时35分钟，Environmental problems are too big for individuals to solve. Do you agree?（250词）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"两周话题深挖后你的写作库里已有教育+环境两大话题。继续攒，阶段四时你会有10个话题的完整弹药库。"}},{"w":31,"p":3,"theme":"科技话题深挖","d":[{"t":"科技前沿词汇","obj":"掌握前沿科技词，掌握虚拟条件句3型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"innovation","m":"创新","p":"n.","e":"Innovation drives progress."},{"w":"automation","m":"自动化","p":"n.","e":"Automation replaced some jobs."},{"w":"algorithm","m":"算法","p":"n.","e":"The algorithm learns your taste."},{"w":"artificial intelligence","m":"人工智能","p":"n.","e":"AI is changing medicine."},{"w":"virtual","m":"虚拟的","p":"adj.","e":"Virtual tours save travel costs."}],"g":{"t":"虚拟条件句3型（对过去的虚拟）","exp":"If the internet had not been invented, life would have been slower.（如果没发明互联网，生活会更慢。）结构：If+过去完成(had done), would have done。对过去“马后炮”的正式句型。","ex":["If I had studied coding, I would have gotten the job.","If phones had not existed, we would have written letters.","She would have passed if she had tried again."]},"pr":"1) 写5句虚拟3型（科技如果没出现...）。2) 用新词写3句科技句。3) 口语讨论：AI会取代人类工作吗？","tip":"虚拟3型是语法学界的“珠穆朗玛”。今天登顶后，你的语法装备就齐全了。"},{"t":"科技影响","obj":"掌握科技影响词汇，掌握混合虚拟","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"transform","m":"彻底改变","p":"v.","e":"The internet transformed shopping."},{"w":"revolutionize","m":"使革命性变化","p":"v.","e":"AI revolutionized translation."},{"w":"obsolete","m":"过时的","p":"adj.","e":"Old skills become obsolete."},{"w":"disruptive","m":"颠覆性的","p":"adj.","e":"The app was disruptive at first."},{"w":"breakthrough","m":"突破","p":"n.","e":"The vaccine was a breakthrough."}],"g":{"t":"混合虚拟（过去条件+现在结果）","exp":"If I had learned English earlier, I would be a teacher now.（要是早点学英语，我现在就是老师了。）= 过去的条件+现在的结果，从句had done，主句would do。最自然的“马后炮”。","ex":["If we had invested in solar, we would be rich now.","If you had told me, I would not be worried.","Had they acted, the city would be cleaner today."]},"pr":"1) 写5句混合虚拟。2) 写“一项改变生活的技术”（100词）。3) 口语讨论：哪种技术最有颠覆性？","tip":"混合虚拟在口语里出现频率很高，因为它就是日常感慨：早知道...就...。练到脱口而出。"},{"t":"科技伦理","obj":"掌握伦理词汇，掌握but for/without虚拟","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"ethics","m":"伦理","p":"n.","e":"AI raises ethics questions."},{"w":"surveillance","m":"监控","p":"n.","e":"Street surveillance is common."},{"w":"manipulate","m":"操纵","p":"v.","e":"Ads manipulate our choices."},{"w":"regulate","m":"监管","p":"v.","e":"Who should regulate AI?"},{"w":"privacy concern","m":"隐私担忧","p":"n.","e":"Privacy concerns are growing."}],"g":{"t":"but for / without（要不是...）","exp":"But for the internet, remote work would be impossible.（要不是互联网，远程办公不可能。）without同理。含蓄版虚拟条件，写作里的“暗器”。","ex":["But for smartphones, we would still use maps.","Without funding, the project would have died.","But for luck, I would have missed the flight."]},"pr":"1) 写5句but for/without虚拟。2) 写“科技监管该多严”（100词）。3) 口语讨论：人脸识别利大于弊吗？","tip":"but for一出口，考官眼前一亮。它小众但极地道，是口语写作的双料加分项。"},{"t":"未来科技","obj":"掌握未来科技词汇，掌握wish对过去的虚拟","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"superintelligence","m":"超级智能","p":"n.","e":"Superintelligence worries experts."},{"w":"nanotechnology","m":"纳米技术","p":"n.","e":"Nanotechnology treats disease."},{"w":"biotech","m":"生物科技","p":"n.","e":"Biotech grows fast."},{"w":"immortality","m":"永生","p":"n.","e":"Immortality remains a dream."},{"w":"Mars colony","m":"火星殖民地","p":"n.","e":"A Mars colony may exist by 2050."}],"g":{"t":"wish + 过去完成（对过去的愿望）","exp":"I wish I had bought that stock.（真希望我买了那股票。）wish+had done=对过去的遗憾，和if only had done同义。口语Part 2讲遗憾经历专用。","ex":["I wish I had learned coding sooner.","She wishes she had kept her old laptop.","We wish we had traveled more."]},"pr":"1) 写5句wish+had done（人生遗憾清单）。2) 口头畅想：2040年的生活（90秒）。3) 口语讨论：想活到150岁吗？","tip":"虚拟语气全家桶已集齐（wish/would rather/if only/3型/混合/but for）。之后每天挑一个用一用，别让它们生锈。"},{"t":"科技利弊","obj":"综合运用科技话题辩证讨论","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"pros and cons","m":"利与弊","p":"n.","e":"Weigh the pros and cons first."},{"w":"outweigh","m":"超过（重要性）","p":"v.","e":"Benefits outweigh the risks."},{"w":"overreliance","m":"过度依赖","p":"n.","e":"Overreliance on GPS weakens memory."},{"w":"addictive","m":"使人上瘾的","p":"adj.","e":"Short videos are addictive."},{"w":"isolated","m":"孤立的","p":"adj.","e":"Online life can feel isolated."}],"g":{"t":"利弊讨论框架","exp":"万能框架：The pros are obvious: first..., second... However, we cannot ignore the cons: ... On balance, the benefits outweigh the drawbacks. 科技话题作文直接填空。","ex":["The pros of AI are obvious: it saves time and cuts costs.","However, we cannot ignore the risks.","On balance, the benefits outweigh the drawbacks."]},"pr":"1) 写150词：Does technology make us lonelier?（用pros/cons框架）。2) 口语辩论：正反各90秒。3. 整理科技话题金句卡。","tip":"三个话题深挖（教育/环境/科技）完成。你的写作弹药库已能应对一半的雅思题目。"}],"sun":{"t":"第31周自检：科技话题","obj":"检验虚拟语气全家桶和科技词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 语法专项15题（虚拟语气综合）。3) 写作：限时35分钟，Artificial intelligence will do more good than harm. To what extent do you agree?（250词）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"虚拟语气是7分语法的皇冠。你已经戴上了它。以后写作记得每周至少用一次，保持手感。"}},{"w":32,"p":3,"theme":"健康话题（Task 1图表）","d":[{"t":"医疗词汇","obj":"掌握就医词汇，开始Task 1图表动词训练","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"symptom","m":"症状","p":"n.","e":"The main symptom is fever."},{"w":"diagnose","m":"诊断","p":"v.","e":"The doctor diagnosed the flu."},{"w":"prescribe","m":"开（药）","p":"v.","e":"She prescribed some rest."},{"w":"treatment","m":"治疗","p":"n.","e":"The treatment lasts a week."},{"w":"surgery","m":"外科手术","p":"n.","e":"The surgery went well."}],"g":{"t":"Task 1 图表动词（上升）","exp":"上升家族：rise / increase / grow / climb / surge（飙升）/ rocket（火箭式上升）/ peak（达峰）。区分幅度：surge和rocket是剧烈上升，climb是缓慢攀升。图表作文词汇第一步。","ex":["Cases surged in winter.","Costs climbed steadily.","The number peaked in July."]},"pr":"1) 用7个上升动词各写1句（编数据）。2) 写“一次生病就医”的经历（80词）。3. 口语讨论：生病该硬扛还是看医生？","tip":"Task 1动词不是难在认，而是难在“用得准”。同一趋势用不同的词，Lexical Resource就上去了。"},{"t":"疾病预防","obj":"掌握疾病词汇，掌握Task 1数据句型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"epidemic","m":"流行病","p":"n.","e":"The epidemic lasted two years."},{"w":"vaccine","m":"疫苗","p":"n.","e":"The vaccine arrived in 2021."},{"w":"immune","m":"免疫的","p":"adj.","e":"Exercise keeps you immune-strong."},{"w":"chronic","m":"慢性的","p":"adj.","e":"Chronic diseases need patience."},{"w":"obesity","m":"肥胖（症）","p":"n.","e":"Obesity rates keep rising."}],"g":{"t":"Task 1 数据描述句型","exp":"黄金句型：In 2020, the number stood at 50%.（位于50%）/ It rose to 60% by 2022.（升至60%）/ This represented a 10% increase.（这代表10%的增长）/ The figure for men was twice that for women.（是女性两倍）","ex":["In 2019, cases stood at 20,000.","This represented a 15% increase.","The figure for women was higher."]},"pr":"1) 把一组编造数据写成5句（用上黄金句型）。2) 写“疫情改变了什么”（80词）。3) 口语讨论：疫苗该强制吗？","tip":"Task 1六分和七分的差距：六分重复rise和increase，七分用stand at / represent / the figure for变换。今天开始变换。"},{"t":"医疗体系","obj":"掌握医疗体系词汇，掌握Task 1趋势词汇","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"insurance","m":"保险","p":"n.","e":"Insurance covered the bill."},{"w":"clinic","m":"诊所","p":"n.","e":"The clinic opens till nine."},{"w":"emergency","m":"急诊；紧急情况","p":"n.","e":"Call the emergency number."},{"w":"ambulance","m":"救护车","p":"n.","e":"The ambulance came fast."},{"w":"waiting list","m":"候诊名单","p":"n.","e":"The waiting list is long."}],"g":{"t":"Task 1 趋势词汇（下降与平稳）","exp":"下降家族：fall / drop / decline / decrease / plummet（暴跌）/ plunge。平稳：remain stable / stay constant / level off。组合拳：fell slightly / dropped sharply / remained stable throughout.","ex":["Waiting times dropped sharply.","Costs fell slightly then leveled off.","The rate remained stable for a decade."]},"pr":"1) 用下降/平稳词汇写5句。2) 造一组“疫情前后医疗数据”并描述。3) 口语讨论：公立vs私立医疗？","tip":"趋势+幅度副词（slightly/sharply/steadily）是Task 1的“标点符号”。少了它们，数据只是数字，不是语言。"},{"t":"心理健康","obj":"掌握心理健康词汇，掌握Task 1比较表达","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"stigma","m":"污名","p":"n.","e":"The stigma around therapy is fading."},{"w":"burnout","m":"职业倦怠","p":"n.","e":"Burnout hits young workers."},{"w":"resilience","m":"心理韧性","p":"n.","e":"Resilience can be trained."},{"w":"wellbeing","m":"身心健康","p":"n.","e":"Sleep protects wellbeing."},{"w":"therapy","m":"（心理）治疗","p":"n.","e":"Therapy changed my life."}],"g":{"t":"Task 1 比较表达","exp":"比较家族：while / whereas / in contrast / by comparison / compared with。句式：While urban rates rose, rural rates fell. / In contrast, the south remained flat. 数据对比=图表作文的骨架。","ex":["While cases rose in cities, they fell in towns.","In contrast, the second group improved.","Compared with men, women scored higher."]},"pr":"1) 写5句比较句（编数据）。2) 写“心理健康三大敌人”（100词）。3) 口语讨论：该给员工放“心理健康假”吗？","tip":"Task 1高分=动词准+幅度准+对比巧。三大件已集齐，明天组装成篇。"},{"t":"健康生活方式","obj":"掌握Task 1完整结构，写第一篇图表作文","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"lifestyle","m":"生活方式","p":"n.","e":"A healthy lifestyle prevents disease."},{"w":"sedentary","m":"久坐的","p":"adj.","e":"Sedentary jobs harm the back."},{"w":"preventive","m":"预防性的","p":"adj.","e":"Preventive care saves money."},{"w":"longevity","m":"长寿","p":"n.","e":"Longevity runs in families."},{"w":"life expectancy","m":"预期寿命","p":"n.","e":"Life expectancy rose to 78."}],"g":{"t":"Task 1 完整结构四段式","exp":"标准结构：开头段（改写题目：The chart shows...→The chart illustrates...）→ 总览段（Overview：最重要趋势，2句话，必须有！）→ 细节段1（数据A）→ 细节段2（数据B）。总览段是6.5和7的分界线。","ex":["The chart illustrates changes in life expectancy from 1990 to 2020.","Overall, the figure rose steadily in both countries.","In detail, the UK started higher, at 75 years.","However, China grew faster, overtaking the UK in 2010."]},"pr":"限时20分钟写第一篇Task 1：描述“1990-2020两国预期寿命”折线图（150词，编数据也要有总览段）。写完对照结构自查。","tip":"第一篇图表作文肯定不完美。收好它——阶段四模拟周你会重写它，亲眼见证自己的成长曲线。"}],"sun":{"t":"第32周自检：健康话题+Task 1","obj":"检验图表作文语言和健康词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) Task 1再练一篇：描述“不同年龄段运动比例”柱状图（限时20分钟）。3) 口语模拟：Describe a time when you were ill（90秒）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"Task 1的语言武器已全部就位。剩下的就是练习不同图表类型：线图、柱图、饼图、表格，每周轮着来一篇。"}},{"w":33,"p":3,"theme":"政府话题（Task 2结构）","d":[{"t":"政府职能词汇","obj":"掌握政府核心词，掌握Task 2四段式结构","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"authority","m":"当局；权力","p":"n.","e":"Local authorities built the park."},{"w":"legislation","m":"法律；立法","p":"n.","e":"New legislation banned smoking."},{"w":"regulation","m":"法规；监管","p":"n.","e":"Food regulation protects us."},{"w":"policy","m":"政策","p":"n.","e":"The policy changed in 2020."},{"w":"administration","m":"行政部门","p":"n.","e":"The administration funds schools."}],"g":{"t":"Task 2 四段式结构","exp":"开头段（2-3句：改写题目+亮明立场）→ 主体1（观点A+论据+例子）→ 主体2（观点B/让步+论据）→ 结尾（1-2句重申）。立场必须鲜明：完全同意/部分同意/不同意。骑墙=低分。","ex":["It is argued that governments should fund the arts. I partly agree.","The main reason is that art benefits health.","However, hospitals may need money more.","In conclusion, both matter, but health comes first."]},"pr":"1) 写“政府该不该资助艺术”的开头段和结尾段（限时10分钟）。2) 用新词写3句政府职能句。3) 口语讨论：政府最重要的职能是什么？","tip":"政府话题是雅思写作四大金刚之一（政府/教育/科技/环境）。四段式结构今天装进脑子，之后反复使用直到自动化。"},{"t":"税收与福利","obj":"掌握税收福利词汇，掌握Task 2主体段写法","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"tax","m":"税","p":"n./v.","e":"Income tax funds hospitals."},{"w":"welfare","m":"福利","p":"n.","e":"Welfare supports the old."},{"w":"subsidy","m":"补贴","p":"n.","e":"Farm subsidies keep food cheap."},{"w":"pension","m":"养老金","p":"n.","e":"The pension rose by 3%."},{"w":"allowance","m":"津贴","p":"n.","e":"Students get a small allowance."}],"g":{"t":"主体段写法（论点+论据+例子）","exp":"主体段三件套：主题句（First, taxes reduce inequality.）→ 解释（This is because the rich pay more.）→ 例子（In Sweden, for instance, high taxes fund free healthcare.）一段=一个观点，别贪多。","ex":["First, taxes can reduce inequality.","This is because the rich pay a larger share.","In Sweden, for instance, this funds free healthcare."]},"pr":"1) 写“税收主体段”（主题句+解释+例子，限时10分钟）。2) 用新词写3句福利句。3) 口语讨论：高税收高福利好不好？","tip":"主体段=观点的集装箱。一箱一观点，箱内三件套（论点/解释/例子），永远不会写着写着跑偏。"},{"t":"公共服务","obj":"掌握公共服务词汇，掌握让步反驳段","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"infrastructure","m":"基础设施","p":"n.","e":"Roads are basic infrastructure."},{"w":"facility","m":"设施","p":"n.","e":"Sports facilities improve health."},{"w":"maintain","m":"维护","p":"v.","e":"Parks need maintaining."},{"w":"fund","m":"拨款；资助","p":"v./n.","e":"The city funded the project."},{"w":"public spending","m":"公共开支","p":"n.","e":"Public spending rose this year."}],"g":{"t":"让步反驳段（Admittedly... However...）","exp":"高分段式：Admittedly, building hospitals is expensive.（诚然...）However, the long-term savings are greater.（但...）比起单边论证，让步反驳展示思维深度，是6.5到7的关键一跃。","ex":["Admittedly, public spending is limited.","However, prevention saves more later.","Admittedly, parks are costly; however, they pay back in health."]},"pr":"1) 写一个让步反驳段（公共服务话题，限时10分钟）。2) 用新词写3句公共设施句。3) 口语讨论：地铁修到郊区值得吗？","tip":"让步反驳=先接住对方一拳，再打出自己的重拳。考官最爱这种“会打太极”的文章。"},{"t":"政府职责边界","obj":"掌握职责词汇，掌握高分衔接词","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"intervene","m":"干预","p":"v.","e":"Should the state intervene?"},{"w":"prohibit","m":"禁止","p":"v.","e":"Smoking is prohibited in parks."},{"w":"enforce","m":"执行；强制","p":"v.","e":"Rules must be enforced."},{"w":"prioritize","m":"优先处理","p":"v.","e":"Cities must prioritize housing."},{"w":"allocate","m":"分配","p":"v.","e":"How should money be allocated?"}],"g":{"t":"高分衔接词清单","exp":"递进：Furthermore / Moreover / In addition。转折：Nevertheless / Nonetheless。因果：Consequently / Hence。让步：Admittedly / Granted。总结：In conclusion / To conclude。每周挑2个新词用熟，别一次全上。","ex":["Furthermore, clean parks attract tourists.","Nevertheless, budgets remain limited.","Consequently, cities must choose wisely."]},"pr":"1) 用5个衔接词各写1句（政府话题）。2) 写“政府该管什么不该管什么”主体段（100词）。3) 口语讨论：该禁烟吗？","tip":"衔接词是文章的润滑油。太少会卡，太多会滑（显得空洞）。每段1-2个刚刚好。"},{"t":"政治话题写作","obj":"完成一篇完整的政府类大作文","time":"50分钟","v":[{"w":"democracy","m":"民主","p":"n.","e":"Democracy needs participation."},{"w":"corruption","m":"腐败","p":"n.","e":"Corruption wastes public money."},{"w":"transparency","m":"透明度","p":"n.","e":"Transparency builds trust."},{"w":"election","m":"选举","p":"n.","e":"Elections happen every five years."},{"w":"citizen","m":"公民","p":"n.","e":"Citizens pay taxes and vote."}],"g":{"t":"完整作文组装（四段式全流程）","exp":"今天组装完整政府类作文：开头（立场：部分同意）→ 主体1（税收该做什么）→ 主体2（让步：市场也有责任）→ 结尾（重申+建议）。全程限时40分钟，用上本周所有句型。","ex":["Governments should spend more on public health. I partly agree.","First, healthy citizens work and pay taxes.","Admittedly, individuals must also exercise.","On balance, government action matters more."]},"pr":"限时40分钟完成：Some people think governments should spend more on public services rather than on the arts. To what extent do you agree?（250词）。写完自查四段式+让步段+衔接词。","tip":"这是你第二篇完整大作文（第一篇在26周）。两篇对比一下——两个月的时间，你的进步看得见。"}],"sun":{"t":"第33周自检：政府话题+Task 2","obj":"检验议论文完整结构和政府词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 复盘本周作文：列出3个优点+3个待改进点。3) 口语模拟：Describe a public facility you often use（90秒）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"Task 2的结构、让步、衔接三件套已集齐。剩下的话题（全球化/城市/犯罪/媒体）都是往这套框架里填内容。"}},{"w":34,"p":3,"theme":"全球化话题（口语技巧）","d":[{"t":"贸易词汇","obj":"掌握贸易词汇，掌握口语Part 1策略","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"trade","m":"贸易","p":"n./v.","e":"Trade connects the world."},{"w":"export","m":"出口","p":"v./n.","e":"China exports electronics."},{"w":"import","m":"进口","p":"v./n.","e":"The UK imports tea."},{"w":"tariff","m":"关税","p":"n.","e":"Tariffs raise prices."},{"w":"globalization","m":"全球化","p":"n.","e":"Globalization changes everything."}],"g":{"t":"口语 Part 1 策略","exp":"Part 1要短而快：直接回答+1句扩展。公式：Answer + Reason/Example。被问Do you like tea? 答：Yes, especially green tea, because it helps me relax after work. 3句话封顶，考官自会换题。","ex":["Question: Do you like traveling?","Answer: Yes, I love it, especially road trips, because I can stop anywhere I like.","Never answer with just 'Yes' or 'No'."]},"pr":"1) 录音回答10个Part 1常见题（每题3句内）。2) 用新词写3句贸易句。3) 自评：我的回答够简洁吗？","tip":"Part 1不是聊天比赛，是热身赛。短、准、带原因，就够了。"},{"t":"跨国公司","obj":"掌握跨国公司词汇，掌握Part 2话题卡策略","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"multinational","m":"跨国的","p":"adj.","e":"A multinational company has offices worldwide."},{"w":"corporation","m":"大公司","p":"n.","e":"The corporation employs 50,000."},{"w":"subsidiary","m":"子公司","p":"n.","e":"The factory is a subsidiary."},{"w":"merger","m":"合并","p":"n.","e":"The merger created a giant."},{"w":"market share","m":"市场份额","p":"n.","e":"Their market share reached 30%."}],"g":{"t":"口语 Part 2 策略（话题卡）","exp":"Part 2=1分钟笔记+2分钟独白。笔记四格法：WHO/WHAT（是什么）、WHEN/WHERE（时间地点）、WHY（为什么特别）、FEELING（感受）。四格各记2-3个词，说的时候按格推进，永远不会断片。","ex":["Topic: Describe a company you admire.","Notes: tech firm / 2010 founded / green mission / inspiring culture","Story: I first heard of it when...","Feeling: What impressed me most was..."]},"pr":"1) 用四格法准备话题卡：Describe a successful company（笔记+90秒录音）。2) 用新词写3句公司句。3) 自评录音流利度。","tip":"四格笔记法是Part 2的救生圈。四格记满，再紧张也能说满两分钟。"},{"t":"全球化影响","obj":"掌握全球化影响词汇，掌握Part 3策略","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"homogenize","m":"同质化","p":"v.","e":"Cities homogenize: same shops everywhere."},{"w":"diversity","m":"多样性","p":"n.","e":"Diversity makes cities rich."},{"w":"interdependence","m":"相互依存","p":"n.","e":"Trade creates interdependence."},{"w":"cultural invasion","m":"文化入侵","p":"n.","e":"Some fear cultural invasion."},{"w":"identity","m":"认同；身份","p":"n.","e":"Local food keeps identity."}],"g":{"t":"口语 Part 3 策略（抽象讨论）","exp":"Part 3讨论社会性大问题，答题公式：观点（I think...）+原因（because...）+例子（For example, in China...）+对比（However, some people...）。四步走，答案自带深度。","ex":["I think globalization brings both wealth and worries.","This is because trade creates jobs but kills diversity.","For example, coffee shops look alike worldwide.","However, local cultures are fighting back."]},"pr":"1) 用四步公式回答5个Part 3问题（录音）。2) 用新词写3句全球化句。3) 自评：有没有每步都走到？","tip":"Part 3是考官判断你真实水平的“探底器”。四步公式就是你的防沉装备。"},{"t":"经济问题","obj":"掌握经济问题词汇，练口语流利度","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"inflation","m":"通货膨胀","p":"n.","e":"Inflation raised food prices."},{"w":"recession","m":"经济衰退","p":"n.","e":"The recession hit exports."},{"w":"unemployment","m":"失业","p":"n.","e":"Unemployment fell this year."},{"w":"poverty","m":"贫困","p":"n.","e":"Trade helps reduce poverty."},{"w":"inequality","m":"不平等","p":"n.","e":"Inequality is still rising."}],"g":{"t":"口语流利度技巧（填充语）","exp":"卡壳别沉默，用思考填充语：Well, that's an interesting question... / Let me think... / To be honest... / How should I put it... 争取3秒思考时间，考官听到的是流利。","ex":["Well, that's a big question.","Let me think... I would say trade does more good.","To be honest, I hadn't thought about it before."]},"pr":"1) 录音回答3个难题，强制使用填充语。2) 用新词写3句经济句。3) 口语讨论：全球经济一体化让谁受益？","tip":"流利≠说得快，而是“没有冷场”。填充语就是口语的节拍器。"},{"t":"发展话题","obj":"掌握发展词汇，掌握口语连接词","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"developing","m":"发展中的","p":"adj.","e":"Developing countries grow fast."},{"w":"foreign aid","m":"国际援助","p":"n.","e":"Foreign aid built the hospital."},{"w":"prosperity","m":"繁荣","p":"n.","e":"Trade brought prosperity."},{"w":"gap","m":"差距","p":"n.","e":"The wealth gap is widening."},{"w":"sustainable growth","m":"可持续增长","p":"n.","e":"We need sustainable growth."}],"g":{"t":"口语连接词（talk的“路标”）","exp":"连接词让独白有路标：First of all... / Another thing is... / On top of that... / What I mean is... / So anyway... 有了路标，考官跟得上你的思路。","ex":["First of all, globalization creates jobs.","Another thing is that ideas travel faster.","So anyway, I think it is mostly positive."]},"pr":"1) 用路标连接词做90秒独白：全球化利与弊。2) 用新词写3句发展句。3) 全套口语模拟：P1热身5题+P2话题卡+P3讨论2题（全程录音）。","tip":"今天的全套模拟是第一次“完整口语考试”。留好录音，第48周全真模拟时对比——你会在自己声音里听到成长。"}],"sun":{"t":"第34周自检：全球化+口语","obj":"检验口语三部分策略和全球化词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 全套口语模拟录音15分钟（P1+P2+P3）。3) 听回放，按流利度/词汇/语法/发音四项各打分1-5。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"口语和写作一样需要“改错”。录音回听就是口语的错题本。"}},{"w":35,"p":3,"theme":"城市化话题（听力技巧）","d":[{"t":"城市化词汇","obj":"掌握城市化词汇，掌握听力Section 3策略","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"urbanization","m":"城市化","p":"n.","e":"Urbanization moved millions to cities."},{"w":"migration","m":"迁移","p":"n.","e":"Rural migration fills cities."},{"w":"metropolis","m":"大都市","p":"n.","e":"Shanghai is a metropolis."},{"w":"overcrowding","m":"过度拥挤","p":"n.","e":"Overcrowding strains schools."},{"w":"slum","m":"贫民窟","p":"n.","e":"Slums grew at the city edge."}],"g":{"t":"听力 Section 3 策略（学术讨论）","exp":"S3=两三个学生讨论作业。技巧：1) 读题预判场景（作业类型：presentation/essay/report）；2) 注意转折词but/however后才是重点；3) 说话人态度题听语气（doubt/enthusiasm）。","ex":["But I think the survey part is weak...","Actually, that's not what I meant.","Hmm, I'm not sure about that."]},"pr":"1) 找一段英语讨论音频（播客对话），练预判+抓转折词。2) 用新词写3句城市化句。3) 口语讨论：大城市为什么吸引人？","tip":"S3的答案喜欢“先错后对”：前面说A，but之后改口B。听到but就竖起耳朵。"},{"t":"住房问题","obj":"掌握住房词汇，掌握听力笔记法","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"housing","m":"住房","p":"n.","e":"Housing prices keep climbing."},{"w":"mortgage","m":"房贷","p":"n.","e":"The mortgage lasts 30 years."},{"w":"tenant","m":"租客","p":"n.","e":"The tenant renewed the contract."},{"w":"affordable","m":"负担得起的","p":"adj.","e":"Affordable housing is scarce."},{"w":"renovate","m":"翻新","p":"v.","e":"The old block was renovated."}],"g":{"t":"听力笔记法（符号+缩写）","exp":"速记符号系统：↑上升 ↓下降 =等于 ≠不等于 w/with wo/without b/c because →导致。名词只写前3个字母。练熟后，听力边听边记不打架。","ex":["Rent ↑ 20% since 2020","old bldg → renovated in 2019","tenant ≠ owner, pays rent"]},"pr":"1) 用符号法记一段英语新闻的5个要点。2) 用新词写3句住房句。3) 口语讨论：年轻人该买房吗？","tip":"笔记不是听写。符号系统的本质：用最少的笔画记最多的信息。"},{"t":"交通治理","obj":"掌握交通治理词汇，攻克听力拼写规范","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"congestion","m":"拥堵","p":"n.","e":"Congestion charges limit traffic."},{"w":"commute","m":"通勤","p":"v./n.","e":"The commute takes an hour."},{"w":"carpool","m":"拼车","p":"v./n.","e":"Carpooling saves money."},{"w":"cycle lane","m":"自行车道","p":"n.","e":"Cycle lanes doubled in a year."},{"w":"charge","m":"收费；指控","p":"v./n.","e":"Drivers pay a city charge."}],"g":{"t":"听力拼写规范（丢分重灾区）","exp":"填空题拼写规则：1) 单复数（听出s）；2) 大小写（街道名首字母大写）；3) 数字写阿拉伯数字更保险；4) 连字符（a 30-minute walk）；5) 常错词：accommodation（双c双m）、government、February。","ex":["Accommodation on Main Street costs more.","The February fee is 30 yuan.","It is a 20-minute walk from the station."]},"pr":"1) 听写自测：10个易错词（accommodation/government/February等）。2) 用新词写3句交通句。3) 口语讨论：拥堵费该收吗？","tip":"听力6.5的考生里，一半是“听对了写错了”。拼写规范是你的免费分数。"},{"t":"社会公平","obj":"掌握社会公平词汇，攻克听力同义替换","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"disparity","m":"差距","p":"n.","e":"Income disparity keeps growing."},{"w":"privilege","m":"特权","p":"n.","e":"Education should not be a privilege."},{"w":"marginalized","m":"被边缘化的","p":"adj.","e":"Marginalized groups need help."},{"w":"accessible","m":"可获得（服务）的","p":"adj.","e":"Make schools accessible to all."},{"w":"equal opportunity","m":"机会均等","p":"n.","e":"Cities promise equal opportunity."}],"g":{"t":"听力同义替换（核心考点）","exp":"雅思听力的本质=同义替换。题干用city centers，录音说downtown areas；题干说cost，录音说fee。练习法：每次做完题，把题目和原文的替换词对抄成表，背下来。","ex":["city centers = downtown areas","cost = fee = charge","important = key = vital","problems = issues = challenges"]},"pr":"1) 整理本周10对同义替换并背。2) 用新词写3句公平句。3) 口语讨论：教育公平怎么实现？","tip":"同义替换表是雅思听力的“武功秘籍”。每周10对，三个月就是120对。"},{"t":"城市规划","obj":"掌握城市规划词汇，掌握听力预判技巧","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"zone","m":"区域","p":"n./v.","e":"The city zoned the river for parks."},{"w":"landscape","m":"景观；风景","p":"n.","e":"The landscape changed fast."},{"w":"heritage building","m":"历史建筑","p":"n.","e":"Heritage buildings were saved."},{"w":"green space","m":"绿地","p":"n.","e":"Green space improves air."},{"w":"facility","m":"设施","p":"n.","e":"Sports facilities doubled."}],"g":{"t":"听力预判技巧（读题30秒怎么用）","exp":"看题干预判：1) 词性（空格填名词还是动词）；2) 场景（租房？课程？）；3) 数字（大概听年份还是价格）。预判越细，听的时候越像“等答案来”而不是“追答案跑”。","ex":["The ___ fee is 30 yuan. → 预判：名词（什么费？）","Move in on ___ → 预判：日期","Maximum ___ people → 预判：数字"]},"pr":"1) 拿一套真题S1，只做读题预判练习（不听力）。2) 用新词写3句规划句。3) 口语讨论：老城改造该保留什么？","tip":"预判做得好，听力像开卷考试；预判不做，听力像雾里开车。30秒读题时间，一秒都不能浪费。"}],"sun":{"t":"第35周自检：城市化+听力","obj":"检验听力四大技巧（预判/笔记/拼写/替换）","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 完整做一套听力S1+S3（真题或模拟题），全程用四大技巧。3) 错题归因：没听到/没听懂/没写对，各占几个？4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"错题归因是提分的关键动作。“没听到”练预判，“没听懂”练精听，“没写对”练拼写——对症下药。"}},{"w":36,"p":3,"theme":"艺术文化话题（阅读技巧）","d":[{"t":"艺术词汇","obj":"掌握艺术词汇，掌握阅读标题匹配题","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"aesthetic","m":"美学的","p":"adj.","e":"The building has aesthetic value."},{"w":"masterpiece","m":"杰作","p":"n.","e":"The painting is a masterpiece."},{"w":"abstract","m":"抽象的","p":"adj.","e":"Abstract art divides opinions."},{"w":"contemporary","m":"当代的","p":"adj.","e":"Contemporary artists use AI."},{"w":"gallery","m":"美术馆","p":"n.","e":"The gallery opens on Fridays."}],"g":{"t":"阅读标题匹配题（List of Headings）","exp":"段落标题题技巧：1) 先读标题选项划关键词；2) 再读段落首二句+末句（重点常在首末）；3) 警惕“细节陷阱”——段中例子不是主旨。主旨=全段服务的那个观点。","ex":["Paragraph focus: the rise of street art","Heading: The move from galleries to streets","Trap: a single artist's story is detail, not focus."]},"pr":"1) 读一篇英语文章，给每段自拟标题（3段以上）。2) 用新词写3句艺术句。3) 口语讨论：艺术是天分还是努力？","tip":"标题题是阅读里的“大分值户”。一题错常连着错。首末句定位法+防细节陷阱，双保险。"},{"t":"文学音乐词汇","obj":"掌握文学音乐词汇，掌握段落信息匹配","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"genre","m":"体裁；类型","p":"n.","e":"Science fiction is my genre."},{"w":"lyric","m":"歌词；抒情的","p":"n./adj.","e":"The lyrics tell a story."},{"w":"melody","m":"旋律","p":"n.","e":"The melody stays in your head."},{"w":"rhythm","m":"节奏","p":"n.","e":"The rhythm speeds up."},{"w":"classic","m":"经典（的）","p":"n./adj.","e":"It is a modern classic."}],"g":{"t":"段落信息匹配（Which paragraph contains...）","exp":"技巧：1) 题干关键词划出来（专有名词/数字最显眼）；2) 记住顺序原则基本失效——乱序！3) 用“人名找段”和“数字找段”先做简单的；4) 剩下的用同义替换定位。","ex":["Question: Where does the writer mention a famous composer?","Scan for: composer names, e.g. Beethoven","Then verify: does that paragraph mention fame?"]},"pr":"1) 读文章练习：找出提到“数字”和“人名”的段落。2) 用新词写3句文学句。3) 口语讨论：读歌词算读诗吗？","tip":"信息匹配题的本质=同义替换+定位速度。先摘“熟透的果子”（人名数字），再啃硬骨头。"},{"t":"文化产业词汇","obj":"掌握文化产业词汇，掌握摘要填空题","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"entertainment","m":"娱乐","p":"n.","e":"The city needs more entertainment."},{"w":"box office","m":"票房","p":"n.","e":"Box office sales broke records."},{"w":"celebrity","m":"名人","p":"n.","e":"Celebrities influence the young."},{"w":"copyright","m":"版权","p":"n.","e":"Copyright protects artists."},{"w":"piracy","m":"盗版","p":"n.","e":"Piracy costs the industry millions."}],"g":{"t":"摘要填空题（Summary）","exp":"技巧：1) 先读摘要挖空，判断每空词性（n./v./adj.）；2) 原词填空（不带词库）→从原文定位段落抄原词；带词库→同义替换后选词。3) 注意字数限制（NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS）。","ex":["Blank: The film made ___ at the box office. → noun expected","Answer found in paragraph C: record profits","Check: two words? yes. correct form? yes."]},"pr":"1) 读文章做摘要填空练习（自挖3个空）。2) 用新词写3句文化句。3) 口语讨论：名人该为粉丝行为负责吗？","tip":"填空题=送分题+送命题之间。词性判断+字数限制+拼写，三关全过才拿分。"},{"t":"艺术价值讨论","obj":"掌握艺术价值词汇，掌握判断题T/F/NG进阶","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"inspiration","m":"灵感","p":"n.","e":"Nature is her inspiration."},{"w":"profound","m":"深刻的","p":"adj.","e":"The book had a profound effect."},{"w":"subjective","m":"主观的","p":"adj.","e":"Art is subjective."},{"w":"emotional","m":"情感的","p":"adj.","e":"Music is deeply emotional."},{"w":"artistic value","m":"艺术价值","p":"n.","e":"Who decides artistic value?"}],"g":{"t":"判断题 T/F/NG 进阶（NG三大特征）","exp":"NOT GIVEN的特征：1) 题干比较级文章没比（题干说more popular，原文没比较）；2) 题干因果文章只有其一；3) 题干主语文章没提。记住：NG≠错，是“没说”。别用自己的常识补。","ex":["Question: The painter was more famous than his teacher.","Text: The painter studied under a famous teacher. → NG (no comparison made)","Text: ...outshone his teacher... → TRUE"]},"pr":"1) 自编5道判断题（含2道NG），自己做并核对。2) 用新词写3句艺术价值句。3) 口语讨论：AI画的画有艺术价值吗？","tip":"NG题是逻辑题不是英语题。记住口诀：文章没说=NG，哪怕常识告诉你对错。"},{"t":"文化传承词汇","obj":"掌握文化传承词汇，掌握长难句解析法","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"folklore","m":"民间传说","p":"n.","e":"Folklore keeps old stories alive."},{"w":"craftsmanship","m":"手艺","p":"n.","e":"The craftsmanship is dying out."},{"w":"intangible","m":"无形的","p":"adj.","e":"Intangible heritage includes songs."},{"w":"revive","m":"复兴","p":"v.","e":"Videos revived the old craft."},{"w":"descendant","m":"后代","p":"n.","e":"Descendants keep the tradition."}],"g":{"t":"长难句三步解析法","exp":"步骤：1) 找主谓（主干）；2) 拆从句（who/which/that/while各管一段）；3) 划修饰（插入语、分词短语先跳过）。例：Craftsmanship, which took centuries to perfect, is now preserved by descendants who livestream their work. 主干=Craftsmanship is preserved。","ex":["Find the backbone: Craftsmanship is preserved.","Cut clauses: which took... / who livestream...","Skim modifiers, read the core meaning."]},"pr":"1) 找3个长难句做三步解析（抄在本上）。2) 用新词写3句传承句。3) 口语讨论：老手艺会消失吗？","tip":"长难句=洋葱，一层层剥。主干剥出来后，90%的“难”都消失了。这招终身受用。"}],"sun":{"t":"第36周自检：艺术话题+阅读","obj":"检验阅读四大题型技巧和艺术词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 限时20分钟完成一篇阅读P1+P2（含判断+匹配+填空题），用上全部技巧。3) 错题归因：定位错/替换没看穿/读不懂，各几个？4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"阅读提速是练出来的。本周计时，下周再计时——用秒表见证自己越来越快。"}},{"w":37,"p":3,"theme":"犯罪法律话题（写作纠错）","d":[{"t":"法律词汇","obj":"掌握法律词汇，复盘时态易错点","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"legal","m":"合法的","p":"adj.","e":"Is it legal to park here?"},{"w":"illegal","m":"非法的","p":"adj.","e":"Illegal parking is common."},{"w":"attorney","m":"律师","p":"n.","e":"The attorney won the case."},{"w":"court","m":"法院","p":"n.","e":"The court opens at nine."},{"w":"justice","m":"正义；司法","p":"n.","e":"Justice was finally served."}],"g":{"t":"时态易错复盘（你的高频错题）","exp":"经典错题三连：1) 时间状语决定时态（last year≠has done）；2) since从句用过去时（since I came）；3) 现在完成vs过去完成的先后（had done先发生）。把上周作文里的时态错全标出来。","ex":["I have visited Beijing last year. → I visited Beijing last year.","I have lived here since I am born. → since I was born."]},"pr":"1) 改错练习10句（时态）。2) 用新词写3句法律句。3) 口语讨论：法律最重要的原则是什么？","tip":"语法纠错周开始。以前学“什么对”，现在学“什么错”——能挑出自己的错，才算真掌握。"},{"t":"犯罪类型词汇","obj":"掌握犯罪词汇，复盘从句易错点","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"theft","m":"盗窃","p":"n.","e":"Theft rose in the area."},{"w":"robbery","m":"抢劫","p":"n.","e":"The robbery happened at night."},{"w":"fraud","m":"诈骗","p":"n.","e":"Online fraud targets the old."},{"w":"vandalism","m":"故意破坏","p":"n.","e":"Vandalism costs schools a lot."},{"w":"violence","m":"暴力","p":"n.","e":"The city cut violence by 20%."}],"g":{"t":"从句易错复盘（关系词误用）","exp":"经典错题三连：1) 先行词是时间/地点但从句缺宾语→用which/that（the city that I visited）；2) 非限从句误用that（, which✓ , that✗）；3) who/whom误用（作宾语用whom，口语可用who）。改10个错句。","ex":["The town that I visited was quiet. (not where)","My mother, who is a nurse, works nights. (not that)","The friend whom I met is a lawyer."]},"pr":"1) 改错练习10句（从句）。2) 用新词写3句犯罪句。3) 口语讨论：网络诈骗怎么防？","tip":"犯罪话题虽敏感，却是雅思写作合法议题：惩罚方式、预防措施、青少年犯罪，都是常规考题。"},{"t":"惩罚预防词汇","obj":"掌握惩罚词汇，学会中式英语纠错","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"punishment","m":"惩罚","p":"n.","e":"The punishment was a fine."},{"w":"deter","m":"威慑","p":"v.","e":"Strict laws deter crime."},{"w":"rehabilitate","m":"改造；康复","p":"v.","e":"Prisons should rehabilitate."},{"w":"sentence","m":"判刑","p":"v./n.","e":"He was sentenced to two years."},{"w":"fine","m":"罚款","p":"n./v.","e":"A small fine may work."}],"g":{"t":"中式英语纠错（Chinglish经典病句）","exp":"高频中式英语：1) I very like it→I really like it；2) My English is poor→My English is limited；3) Learn knowledge→gain knowledge；4) people mountain people sea→huge crowds。逐条替换成地道表达。","ex":["I really like it. (not: I very like it)","My English is limited. (not: poor)","We gained a lot of knowledge. (not: learned)"]},"pr":"1) 改错练习10句（中式英语）。2) 用新词写3句惩罚观点句。3) 口语讨论：监狱的目的是惩罚还是改造？","tip":"中式英语不是语法错，是“直译病”。每周揪出5句，三个月后你的英语会“地道”一个档次。"},{"t":"网络犯罪词汇","obj":"掌握网络犯罪词汇，学会句子升级","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"cybercrime","m":"网络犯罪","p":"n.","e":"Cybercrime grew with online banking."},{"w":"scam","m":"骗局","p":"n./v.","e":"The scam asked for codes."},{"w":"identity theft","m":"身份盗用","p":"n.","e":"Identity theft ruined her credit."},{"w":"phishing","m":"钓鱼（网络）","p":"n.","e":"Phishing emails look real."},{"w":"hack","m":"入侵；破解","p":"v.","e":"Hackers broke the database."}],"g":{"t":"句子升级术（简单句→复杂句）","exp":"三级跳：L1简单句（The man stole data.）→ L2从句（The man who stole data was caught.）→ L3多重结构（The man who stole the data, according to the court, was caught within days.）每周升级5句。","ex":["L1: The scam tricked many people.","L2: The scam which promised free phones tricked many people.","L3: The scam, which offered free phones, tricked hundreds of elderly people within weeks."]},"pr":"1) 把5个简单句升级到L3。2) 用新词写3句网络安全句。3) 口语讨论：老年人最容易受哪种骗？","tip":"写作7分的秘密=每篇作文有2-3个L3级句子。升级术是你从6分跳7.5的跳板。"},{"t":"法律观点讨论","obj":"掌握法律观点词汇，掌握平行结构","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"human rights","m":"人权","p":"n.","e":"Prisoners keep human rights."},{"w":"death penalty","m":"死刑","p":"n.","e":"The death penalty divides opinion."},{"w":"community service","m":"社区服务","p":"n.","e":"Community service rebuilds trust."},{"w":"lenient","m":"宽容的","p":"adj.","e":"Some say courts are lenient."},{"w":"strict","m":"严厉的","p":"adj.","e":"Strict laws cut repeat crimes."}],"g":{"t":"平行结构（Parallelism）","exp":"三项并列要对齐：The law should punish the guilty, protect the innocent, and deter the would-be.（都是动词原形）错版：punish, protecting and to deter✗。列举、比较、时态都要平行。","ex":["Courts should be fair, fast, and free.","He was fined, jailed, and banned.","Crime hurts victims, families, and cities."]},"pr":"1) 写5句平行结构（法律话题）。2) 写辩证段：死刑该不该废？（100词）。3) 口语讨论：重刑能止罪吗？","tip":"平行结构是7分作文的“隐形及格线”。三条并列对不齐，考官的印象分直接掉一档。"}],"sun":{"t":"第37周自检：法律话题+纠错","obj":"检验语法纠错成果和法律词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 综合改错自测20句（时态/从句/中式英语混合）。3) 写作：限时35分钟，Some people think longer prison sentences reduce crime. Others believe education works better. Discuss both views.（250词）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"纠错周的价值在“回头看”。把你三个月来所有作文翻出来再改一遍——你会发现一半问题自己就能解决。"}},{"w":38,"p":3,"theme":"媒体广告话题（写作题型）","d":[{"t":"媒体词汇","obj":"掌握媒体词汇，精读一篇Task 2范文","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"broadcast","m":"广播；播出","p":"v./n.","e":"The show is broadcast live."},{"w":"journalism","m":"新闻业","p":"n.","e":"Good journalism costs money."},{"w":"tabloid","m":"小报","p":"n.","e":"Tabloids love scandals."},{"w":"credibility","m":"公信力","p":"n.","e":"The paper lost credibility."},{"w":"bias","m":"偏见","p":"n.","e":"Every channel has some bias."}],"g":{"t":"范文精读法（怎么读范文）","exp":"精读四步：1) 划出立场句（thesis）；2) 找出每段主题句；3) 抄下3个好句型；4) 盖住范文，自己重写主体段1。光读不写=白读。本周每天精读一篇官方范文。","ex":["Thesis: While media freedom matters, responsibility matters more.","Body topic: First, freedom enables truth-telling.","Good phrase: This is a small price for transparency."]},"pr":"1) 精读一篇官方范文（四步法全做）。2) 用新词写3句媒体句。3) 口语讨论：你信新闻还是自媒体？","tip":"范文学的是结构不是句子。句子会过期（大家都抄就俗了），结构永远保值。"},{"t":"广告词汇","obj":"掌握广告词汇，掌握观点类题型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"target audience","m":"目标受众","p":"n.","e":"Kids are a target audience."},{"w":"slogan","m":"广告语","p":"n.","e":"The slogan is everywhere."},{"w":"endorsement","m":"代言","p":"n.","e":"Celebrity endorsements sell."},{"w":"misleading","m":"误导性的","p":"adj.","e":"Some ads are misleading."},{"w":"exaggerate","m":"夸大","p":"v.","e":"Ads exaggerate benefits."}],"g":{"t":"观点类题型（To what extent do you agree?）","exp":"观点题答法：1) 完全同意/不同意=主体两段都论证自己立场；2) 部分同意=主体1论证同意的部分，主体2谈另一面。立场词：I completely agree / I largely agree / I agree to some extent / I disagree strongly.","ex":["I largely agree that ads should be limited for children.","This is because young minds cannot judge truth.","However, ads also fund free content.","On balance, protection should come first."]},"pr":"1) 写观点题提纲：Ads aimed at children should be banned. To what extent do you agree?（四段提纲）。2) 用新词写3句广告句。3) 口语讨论：广告对儿童的影响？","tip":"观点题最忌“两边都说等于没说”。立场可以温和，但必须清晰。"},{"t":"社交媒体词汇","obj":"掌握社交媒体词汇，掌握报告类题型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"influencer","m":"网红；影响者","p":"n.","e":"Influencers shape shopping."},{"w":"viral","m":"爆火的","p":"adj.","e":"The video went viral."},{"w":"follower","m":"粉丝","p":"n.","e":"She has a million followers."},{"w":"hashtag","m":"话题标签","p":"n.","e":"The hashtag trended all week."},{"w":"cancel culture","m":"抵制文化","p":"n.","e":"Cancel culture worries some."}],"g":{"t":"报告类题型（Report：原因+影响/解决）","exp":"报告题（问原因和解决方案）：Why do people spend so much time online? What are the effects? 结构：开头（改写题目+总览）→ 原因段（2-3个原因）→ 影响段（2-3个影响）/方案段 → 总结。不需要个人立场。","ex":["This essay explores the causes and effects of screen addiction.","One reason is that apps are designed to hold attention.","As a result, sleep and study suffer.","In short, design and habit combine to trap users."]},"pr":"1) 写报告题提纲：Why are influencers so popular? What effects does this have?（四段提纲）。2) 用新词写3句社媒句。3) 口语讨论：网红文化是好是坏？","tip":"报告题=学术小论文，语气客观，别乱插I think。看清题目问什么，就答什么。"},{"t":"媒体责任词汇","obj":"掌握媒体责任词汇，掌握讨论类题型","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"censorship","m":"审查","p":"n.","e":"Censorship limits art too."},{"w":"freedom of speech","m":"言论自由","p":"n.","e":"Freedom of speech has limits."},{"w":"misinformation","m":"虚假信息","p":"n.","e":"Misinformation spreads fast."},{"w":"verify","m":"核实","p":"v.","e":"Verify before you share."},{"w":"accountability","m":"问责","p":"n.","e":"Platforms face accountability."}],"g":{"t":"讨论类题型（Discuss both views）","exp":"双讨论题：Some think X, others think Y. Discuss both views and give your opinion. 结构：开头（改写+预告自己立场）→ 主体1（X方的理由，先复述再评）→ 主体2（Y方的理由）→ 结尾（自己站哪边+为什么）。两面都要写透。","ex":["Some argue that platforms should police content; others defend free speech.","Those favoring control point to misinformation.","Meanwhile, free speech advocates worry about bias.","I lean toward light regulation with clear rules."]},"pr":"1) 写讨论题提纲：Should social media be regulated?（四段提纲）。2) 用新词写3句媒体责任句。3) 口语讨论：谣言该谁管？","tip":"讨论题最容易犯的错=只写自己同意的一方。记住：two views, then your view。"},{"t":"媒体影响讨论","obj":"掌握利弊类题型，完成完整写作","time":"50分钟","v":[{"w":"manipulate","m":"操纵","p":"v.","e":"Ads manipulate emotions."},{"w":"public opinion","m":"舆论","p":"n.","e":"Media shapes public opinion."},{"w":"agenda","m":"议程；意图","p":"n.","e":"Every paper has an agenda."},{"w":"watchdog","m":"监督者","p":"n.","e":"Media is society's watchdog."},{"w":"transparent","m":"透明的","p":"adj.","e":"Platforms must be transparent."}],"g":{"t":"利弊类题型（Do advantages outweigh disadvantages?）","exp":"利弊题：开头亮明“利大于弊/弊大于利”→ 利段（2-3条）→ 弊段（2-3条，可用让步）→ 结尾确认立场。注意：题目问outweigh，就必须给出谁重谁轻的判断。","ex":["The benefits of social media clearly outweigh the drawbacks.","On the plus side, it connects people and spreads news.","Admittedly, it can spread falsehoods.","Still, on balance, the advantages are greater."]},"pr":"限时40分钟完成：Social media does more harm than good. Do the advantages outweigh the disadvantages?（250词，媒体话题全面运用）。","tip":"第四篇完整作文完成。四篇作文放在一起，你已经有了一个小型“写作作品集”——考前冲刺的最好复习材料。"}],"sun":{"t":"第38周自检：媒体话题+写作题型","obj":"检验四大写作题型和媒体词汇","pr":"1) 听写本周25词。2) 四大题型口头复述：观点/报告/讨论/利弊各1句结构。3) 口语模拟：Describe an advertisement you remember（90秒）。4) 滚动复习旧词15个。","tip":"写作四大题型已集齐。剩下一件事：写熟。每种题型至少再各写一篇，框架才会长在手上。"}},{"w":39,"p":3,"theme":"阶段三总复习与评估","d":[{"t":"话题词汇总复习I","obj":"复习环境+教育+科技话题词汇","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"eco-friendly","m":"环保的","p":"adj.","e":"Choose eco-friendly products."},{"w":"curriculum","m":"课程体系","p":"n.","e":"The curriculum was updated."},{"w":"digital","m":"数字的","p":"adj.","e":"We live in a digital world."},{"w":"renewable","m":"可再生的","p":"adj.","e":"Renewable energy is key."},{"w":"innovation","m":"创新","p":"n.","e":"Innovation drives growth."}],"g":{"t":"错题复盘：时态+从句+虚拟混合","exp":"混合语法测试40题：时态（8种）×从句（7种）×虚拟（6种）×情态完成时（4种）。做题时先给每题贴“考点标签”再做——诊断自己的语法盲区。","ex":["Tag: 虚拟3型 → If I had known, I would have acted.","Tag: 让步状语 → Although prices rose, we bought.","Tag: 同位语 → the fact that sales fell"]},"pr":"1) 混合语法测试40题。2) 三大话题词汇自测：每话题抽20个（环境/教育/科技）。3) 错题写进“终极错题本”。","tip":"三阶段学完的语法=一整套工具箱。今天测试哪些工具生锈了，考前全部擦亮。"},{"t":"话题词汇总复习II","obj":"复习健康+政府+全球化话题词汇","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"wellbeing","m":"身心健康","p":"n.","e":"Work affects wellbeing."},{"w":"policy","m":"政策","p":"n.","e":"Good policy needs data."},{"w":"globalization","m":"全球化","p":"n.","e":"Globalization reshapes work."},{"w":"insurance","m":"保险","p":"n.","e":"Insurance spreads risk."},{"w":"interdependence","m":"相互依存","p":"n.","e":"Interdependence grew fast."}],"g":{"t":"写作四大题型复盘","exp":"把四篇完整作文+四份提纲翻出来重读：观点题的立场是否鲜明？报告题有没有答全两问？讨论题两面是否平衡？利弊题有没有“称重”？列出各题型还差的临门一脚。","ex":["Opinion: thesis clear?","Report: both questions answered?","Discussion: two sides balanced?","Advantage: verdict stated?"]},"pr":"1) 重读四篇作文，每篇列1个待改进点。2) 三大话题词汇自测（健康/政府/全球化各20个）。3) 选最弱的题型重写一篇。","tip":"复习不是重看，是重做。今天重写的这一篇，质量应该明显高于四周前的原版。"},{"t":"话题词汇总复习III","obj":"复习城市化+艺术+犯罪+媒体话题词汇","time":"45分钟","v":[{"w":"urbanization","m":"城市化","p":"n.","e":"Urbanization speeds up."},{"w":"heritage","m":"遗产","p":"n.","e":"Old towns are heritage."},{"w":"legislation","m":"立法","p":"n.","e":"Legislation came late."},{"w":"misinformation","m":"虚假信息","p":"n.","e":"Misinformation misleads."},{"w":"infrastructure","m":"基础设施","p":"n.","e":"Cities need infrastructure."}],"g":{"t":"听力阅读技巧复盘","exp":"听力四技（预判/笔记/拼写/替换）+阅读四题型（标题/匹配/填空/判断）+口语三Part公式+Task 1四段式——把技能清单打勾，没把握的标记出来，下周弱项突破专攻。","ex":["Listening: predict before audio? note with symbols?","Reading: headings via first-last sentences?","Speaking: 4-step Part 3 formula?","Writing: overview paragraph in Task 1?"]},"pr":"1) 技能清单自评（16项打勾）。2) 四话题词汇自测（城市化/艺术/犯罪/媒体各20个）。3) 没把握的技能列成“急救清单”。","tip":"技能清单=你的体检报告。阶段四的模拟周就是照着这份报告做“康复训练”。"},{"t":"弱项诊断日","obj":"定位听力阅读弱项，定制突破计划","time":"50分钟","v":[{"w":"diagnose","m":"诊断","p":"v.","e":"Diagnose before you treat."},{"w":"pattern","m":"模式；规律","p":"n.","e":"Find your error pattern."},{"w":"target","m":"目标","p":"n./v.","e":"Target your weakest skill."},{"w":"efficient","m":"高效的","p":"adj.","e":"Efficient practice wins."},{"w":"focus","m":"专注；聚焦","p":"v./n.","e":"Focus beats quantity."}],"g":{"t":"弱项突破方法论","exp":"三步法：1) 数据化（听力错题按题型分类计数）；2) 归因（每类错题找到根本原因：词汇/速度/拼写/替换）；3) 定制（S1数字错→专练数字听写两周）。弱项突破=最高效的提分。","ex":["Data: 8 errors in S4, 5 in matching","Cause: academic vocabulary gaps","Plan: 20 AWL words daily + re-listen"]},"pr":"1) 做一套完整听力+阅读（真题）。2) 错题数据化分类+归因。3) 写一份两周弱项突破计划（贴墙上）。","tip":"同一套题做对不重要，重要的是知道自己为什么错。弱项诊断是聪明考生的秘密武器。"},{"t":"阶段三毕业评估","obj":"四科全真自测，规划冲刺阶段","time":"60分钟","v":[{"w":"overall","m":"总体的","p":"adj./adv.","e":"Assess overall progress."},{"w":"estimate","m":"估算","p":"v./n.","e":"Estimate your band score."},{"w":"milestone","m":"里程碑","p":"n.","e":"This is a milestone."},{"w":"sprint","m":"冲刺","p":"v./n.","e":"The final sprint begins."},{"w":"potential","m":"潜力","p":"n.","e":"You have more potential."}],"g":{"t":"阶段四预告：全真模拟冲刺","exp":"阶段四（40-52周）：每周话题词汇+分科模拟轮换（听力→阅读→写作→口语），最后三周为考前冲刺（词汇总复习→模考周→心态调整）。B2→6.5的最后一段路，节奏是“模拟→分析→突破”。","ex":["Weeks 40-43: topic words + one mock paper weekly","Weeks 44-47: synonym sets + writing/speaking polish","Weeks 48-52: full mock week + final sprint"]},"pr":"1) 四科自测：听力+阅读各一套（限时），写作一篇，口语录音一套题。2) 对照评分标准粗估分数（写作口语可找范文对比）。3) 写阶段四目标与考试报名计划。","tip":"39周走到这里，你已完成B2水平的全部输入学习。接下来13周，是把知识变成分数的“转化期”。"}],"sun":{"t":"阶段三毕业考：四科全真测试","obj":"全面检验第27-39周学习成果","pr":"1) 词汇大考：本阶段325词抽50个（≥40合格）。2) 语法大考：综合50题。3) 听力+阅读：各一套限时测试。4) 写作：Task 1+Task 2各一篇（限时60分钟）。5) 口语：三Part完整录音15分钟。6) 写阶段四计划书。","tip":"这是入冲刺阶段前的“体检日”。四科分数写下来——第48周全真模拟周结束后再测一次，两条曲线对比，就是你的成长证明。"}}];
